+## Quotes and slippage
+
+The swap examples copied two quoting bugs from the SDK's demo repo. They decided which side the creator fee is on without looking at the swap direction, and they charged the tier's creator fee even on pools that have it disabled. In the 2026-11-21 sample, 213 of 615 pools had the creator fee on, all of them on `OnlyToken0` (174) or `OnlyToken1` (39), and every tier's rate is non-zero, so both bugs misprice real pools. The docs also said the SDK applies Token-2022 transfer fees and that the program checks slippage against what the vault sends; neither is true.
